{
  "slug": "bigdata-com",
  "name": "Bigdata Com",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official Bigdata.com plugin providing financial research, analytics, and intelligence tools powered by Bigdata MCP.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `bigdata-catalyst-monitor` (Map the dated events that could move a public company over the next few quarters, using Bigdata.com data…), `bigdata-company-brief` (Generate a company brief — a cited 30-day summary of what happened at a public company and why…), `bigdata-country-analysis` (Produce a deep country economic analysis using Bigdata.com data — GDP, inflation, monetary policy, labor markets, debt mechanics,…), `bigdata-country-sector-analysis` (Analyze a specific sector inside a specific country or region using Bigdata.com data — combining the macroeconomic backdrop…), `bigdata-cross-sector` (Compare two or more sectors using Bigdata.com data — relative valuations, earnings growth, analyst sentiment, and where each…), `bigdata-earnings-digest` (Analyze a public company's latest reported earnings — a cited post-print digest using Bigdata.com data (results, consensus and…), `bigdata-earnings-preview` (Create a forward-looking earnings preview for a public company ahead of its next earnings call, using Bigdata.com data…), `bigdata-earnings-quality-screen` (Screen a public company's reported earnings for quality and accounting red flags using Bigdata.com data and filings), and 19 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `bigdata.com`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install bigdata-com@claude-plugins-official` from `Bigdata-com/bigdata-plugins-marketplace` (`plugins/bigdata-com`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 27,
    "mcp": 1
  },
